    "detailed_description": "Cow's Girl Caf\u00e9 invites you to immerse yourself in a world where your management skills and your ability to get to know girls better are essential. Your goal will be to interact with two charming girls, vital to the production of milk that you will use to satisfy your demanding customers.<br><br><strong>Milking girls</strong><br>Once you gain enough confidence, you can milk the girls for precious milk. Milking is a process that requires attention and precision to ensure the quality of the product. and will be the main currency of the game<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2935700/extras/4149233ee8f2ee1fea2fee13ed767db8.avif?t=1747172882\" width=600 height=337 /></span><br><br><strong>Mini stories with girls</strong><br>Interact with the girls through meaningful dialogue to understand their personalities, and delve deeper into the story and characters within the caf\u00e9<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2935700/extras/9570257b152893793f0725453f514647.avif?t=1747172882\" width=600 height=337 /></span><br><br><strong>expansion and improvements</strong><br>Use your earnings to purchase advanced milking machinery, which will increase the speed and quantity of milk collected<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2935700/extras/231c645fbba6c56015ff276e1fc1285b.avif?t=1747172882\" width=600 height=337 /></span><br><strong>Orders</strong><br>Take orders from the caf\u00e9's customers, each with specific requests. The goal is to complete the requests in time to get money for milk.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2935700/extras/d3c14fa94d5ac185cec62a1cb8948189.avif?t=1747172882\" width=600 height=337 /></span><br><strong>Deliveries</strong><br>Deliver fresh milk to customers who cannot visit your caf\u00e9.<br>Unlock and send new girls on milk deliveries to earn money passively.<br><br><strong>Gift</strong><br>give girls their favorite type of objects to increase their affection towards you!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2935700/extras/94684c40dfc6a16f3e29c168867f141d.avif?t=1747172882\" width=600 height=337 /></span>",
