ight=337 /></span><br><strong>Deliveries</strong><br>Deliver fresh milk to customers who cannot visit your caf\u00e9.<br>Unlock and send new girls on milk deliveries to earn money passively.<br><br><strong>Gift</strong><br>give girls their favorite type of objects to increase their affection towards you!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2935700/extras/94684c40dfc6a16f3e29c168867f141d.avif?t=1747172882\" width=600 height=337 /></span>",
